# Make the Drow ranger of tools/keys/ranger-twf-gear-save.keys and SAVE him at
# the end of creation, with nothing played: that script enters wizard mode and
# hides in play, so its saved character is not the created one and cannot be
# compared with a build of its recorded .char (inc-10v7f phase 7a).
# The Drow reach the gear line "of random 3 to 4" (lib/races.irh:61-65), which
# the File backend must build from its stated entry.
#
#   INCURSION_OPTIONS=tools/fixtures/options-2026-08-22.dat \
#       tools/headless.sh tools/keys/p7a-drow-ranger-save.keys 1
#
# The creation keys below are the ones in ranger-twf-gear-save.keys; the tail
# is the save tail of chargen-default-save.keys, which explains it.

a       # Initial Choices: [a] Create a New Character
n       # Alter the character generation options? -- no
y       # Your options will place the game in Explore Mode. Continue? -- yes
@choose "Drow"
@choose "Ranger"
p       # Attributes: abort to Point Buy, so no roll and no perk decides the build
RIGHT*6 DOWN RIGHT*8 DOWN RIGHT*10 DOWN RIGHT*10 DOWN RIGHT*4 DOWN RIGHT*8 DOWN RIGHT*9
ENTER   # every point spent
y       # Are these your final stats? -- yes
a       # Alignment: the first offered
@while "favoured enemy" a      # the class asks for a favoured enemy
@while "Choose a feat" a
@while "Combat style" t        # two-weapon
@while "Choose a feat" a
@while "Combat style" t
RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN
RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN
RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN
RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN
ENTER y # Done, and confirm keeping the ranks
@while "wish to worship" y
@while "personality archetype" a

@until "System Menu" ESC
@expect "System Menu"
b                       # [b] Save and Continue
@dump:saved
